<aside class="ms-card bf-preview"><p class="ms-kicker">Live forecast</p><strong x-text="money(model.totals.revenue)"></strong><p class="bk-muted text-sm">Revenue after modelled refunds</p><div class="bf-bar"></div><div class="bf-grid my-5"><div><span class="bk-muted text-xs">Leads</span><b class="block" x-text="nf(sum(model.monthTotals.leads))"></b></div><div><span class="bk-muted text-xs">Acquired customers</span><b class="block" x-text="nf(model.totals.customers)"></b></div></div><p class="text-sm">Conservative–aggressive range</p><p class="font-semibold mt-2" x-text="money(comparison[0].totals.revenue)+' – '+money(comparison[2].totals.revenue)"></p><p class="bk-muted text-xs mt-2">A scenario range, not a statistical confidence interval.</p><p class="bk-muted text-xs mt-5">Contribution applies gross margin and deducts modelled marketing costs. It excludes business expenses you have not entered.</p><div class="mt-5"><span class="bf-badge">Assumed</span><span class="bf-badge" x-show="autoFilled.length">Seeded from recorded data</span><p class="bk-muted text-xs mt-2">Inputs remain assumptions after editing. Recorded totals are shown separately in Actuals.</p></div><p class="bk-feedback text-xs mt-4" x-show="model.totals.roas>10">Revenue is over 10× modelled cost. Review customer values, acquisition costs and conversion assumptions.</p><template x-if="allocationWarning"><p class="bk-feedback text-sm mt-4" x-text="allocationWarning"></p></template><button type="button" class="btn-ghost mt-5" @click="tab='scenarios'">Compare scenarios</button></aside>
